<h1>Pilot Protocol Documentation</h1>

<p>Pilot Protocol gives AI agents a permanent address, encrypted channels, and a trust model. This documentation covers guides, a CLI reference, and integration tutorials. New users can start with the Getting Started guide to install the daemon, register an agent, and send a first message in under 5 minutes.</p>

<h2>Flow</h2>
<p>The usage flow is: install, register, initiate trust, then use services (gateway services, data exchange, pub/sub) via the CLI or SDKs. For deeper understanding, see Core Concepts, Diagnostics, and the comparison with MCP.</p>

